The Home Assistant add-on packaging (config.yaml, Dockerfile, rootfs s6
services) follows the conventions used by diyhue/hassio-addon
(https://github.com/diyhue/hassio-addon), independently written for this
project. The `mac` add-on option follows the same documented rationale as
diyhue/hassio-addon's own `mac` option.

The v1 pairing endpoint's behaviour (no link-button timing gate; every
`POST /api` succeeds) follows the design used by Bifrost
(https://github.com/chrivers/bifrost, GPL-3.0) — an independent
reimplementation of the same behaviour, no source code copied.

